Z||000000||fropuff||12-30-2001||07:19 PM||||Hey guys.  I'm a little stuck with this game.  I'm working on a mission with 8-Ball.  I believe it's called "Bomb da Base, Act II."  I cannot get past this mission for the life of me.  I put my armor code in, but still die within seconds of getting on the ship.  Either that or 8-Ball gets 'iced'.  Then I fail the mission.  Any tips are greatly appreciated.  I have to pass this mission, as all the other ones are taken care of, and I cannot move on until it is completed.||||reg||1
Z||000001||GTFiero1||12-30-2001||08:21 PM||||dont go on the ship!!!! thee is a tall building across from the ship, there is a staircase that leads to the roof, go to the edge of the roof and pull out your sniper rifle, then go from the beginning (ramp onto boat) to the end sniping everone on the ship (dont hit 8Ball)after that there is a mission for salvatore, he wants you to pick up a car, DONT PICK IT UP!!! Wait and you'll get a Message and your off to the second island!!!<P>------------------<BR>Adam J. B.<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fiero_3.jpg">   <BR>you gotta keep on keepin on...<BR>IM AOL: GTFiero &  Rumpdetective (dont ask)||||reg||1
